# Cookie bitten 0: the round biscuit of cookie0 (kitchen_biscuit, cocoa chips) with a scalloped bite out of its edge and a few crumbs lying in the bite, 3.6 m
# across and 0.72 m high (60 times life size). Knee cover. Convex collider (a hull over 3 m becomes a mesh).
format 1
collider convex

